{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_read_ch14f", "label": "READ-ch14f \u2014 Chapter 22 'The bracket', main L5937\u2013L6035 (chat 93)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_heading_scan_discipline", "label": "Heading-scan boundary measurement before reading", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every section-read unit's extent is re-measured by heading scan on the member before a line is read, even when a handoff already carries the boundaries \u2014 carried boundaries were found one line high after \u00a722.2."}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_instrument_fault_rewrite_rule", "label": "Instrument faults self-caught are rewritten, never trimmed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A fault found in the reading instrument is repaired in the instrument and the instrument re-run, rather than the failing check being removed, so the verdict count cannot be improved by deletion."}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_golden_banking", "label": "Golden banking: byte size plus md5 per instrument", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An instrument is only trusted once its output is banked with byte count and md5 and reproduces on re-run; the golden is the contract, not the prose summary."}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_computable_prose_instrument_pair", "label": "Paired computable and prose instruments per section read", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each unit is read twice by two banked instruments \u2014 one computing the printed arithmetic, one testing prose claims and pointers \u2014 so a deviation is attributable to a verdict rather than to a reading."}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_member_line_numbering", "label": "Member line numbering versus bundle line numbering", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_f3_four_column_standard", "label": "F.3's four-column standard: method, input set, inputs, refutation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "F.3 states that a claim carrying fewer than four columns is not a weaker version of the same claim but a different kind of object; a robustness recomputation cannot occupy the refutation column."}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_r2_ch14f", "label": "r2-ch14f (computable instrument, golden 7,784 B md5 35f7068c)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_r2_ch14g", "label": "r2-ch14g (prose instrument, golden 14,016 B md5 436ae11b)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_read_ch14f_14f_01", "label": "14f-01 \u2014 \u00a722.1.1.1 claims F.3's highest standard on three of its four columns", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/READ-ch14f.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"i